@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001

### Add a project to read (change the path to a real FEATURES.md)
# @name addProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PM Tool",
  "featuresPath": "C:/CHANDAN S S/Claude Workspace/Claude Code/pm-tool/FEATURES.md"
}

### Snapshot of the project just added
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{addProject.response.body.id}}/snapshot

### Snapshot of a project that does not exist (404 problem+json)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/does-not-exist/snapshot
